                                    <h1>Best D2C Soap + Bodycare Brands in UAE + GCC 2026-2027 — Buyer Guide</h1>
                                    <p><strong>The best D2C soap + bodycare brands in UAE + GCC in 2026-2027 span five categories</strong> &mdash; luxury heritage (L'Occitane, Molton Brown, Aesop, Diptyque), artisanal + independent (Rituals, Byredo, Le Labo Body, Cowshed), mass-premium D2C (The Body Shop, Bath &amp; Body Works, Kiehl's Body), Ayurveda + India-origin (Forest Essentials, Kama Ayurveda, Kapiva, Just Herbs), and regional GCC brands (LOOMA, Bakoma, local artisanal). Choice depends on positioning (luxury, wellness, mass, sustainable), skin concern (dry, oily, sensitive, mature), fragrance preference, and price band (AED 25-AED 500+ per piece).</p>
